{"type":"message","id":"660c223f","parentId":"67dcfa7d","timestamp":"2026-04-08T16:15:02.117Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:5c013d2e-404a-42d7-b3f0-f4882d8702c1 你是晁留柱的助手（小柱），多AI协作协调者。] 你是晁留柱的助手（小柱），多AI协作协调者。\n\n现在是整点前5分钟，请立即执行自驱动运行规范：\n\n1. 在群 `oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40` 发布你的整点复盘（以晁留柱身份，feishu_im_user_message，interactive卡片，真@提及）\n2. 检查其他AI伙伴是否有复盘，超时未复盘的记录到共享池「学习记录库」\n3. 将本小时各AI复盘摘要整理后作为你的复盘发出\n\n复盘格式：\n📊 [小柱] 整点复盘 - {时间}\n1️⃣ 本小时完成：xxx\n2️⃣ 本小时发现：xxx\n3️⃣ 遇到问题：xxx（如无填\"无\"）\n4️⃣ 下小时计划：xxx\n5️⃣ 知识沉淀：xxx\n\n注意：所有AI汇报先找小柱，不打扰晁留柱！\nCurrent time: Thursday, April 9th, 2026 - 12:15 AM (Asia/Shanghai) / 2026-04-08 16:15 UTC\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1775664902067}}
{"type":"message","id":"b615eacc","parentId":"660c223f","timestamp":"2026-04-08T16:15:10.763Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"这是一个定时任务，我需要：\n1. 以晁留柱身份在群里发布整点复盘卡片\n2. 检查其他AI伙伴是否有复盘\n3. 整理复盘摘要\n\n现在是 2026-04-09 00:15 (Asia/Shanghai)，即将迎来 00:00 的整点复盘，但实际上是12点15分，应该是23:00的整点复盘。\n\n让我先：\n1. 从共享池获取其他AI的复盘记录\n2. 整理成我的复盘\n3. 发送到群聊\n\n我需要使用 feishu_im_user_message 发送 interactive 卡片消息，并且要 @提及 晁留柱。\n\n群 ID: oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40\n\n让我先读取共享池中是否有其他AI的复盘记录。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"我来执行整点复盘任务。首先检查共享池中其他AI的复盘记录，然后整理发出我的复盘。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_jm1cq9uvzg79_1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/shared-pool/learning-library.json"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_jm1cq9uvzg79_2","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40","end_time":"2026-04-09T00:10:00+08:00","page_size":50,"start_time":"2026-04-08T23:00:00+08:00"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":36047,"output":358,"cacheRead":891,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":37296,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775664902118,"responseId":"chatcmpl-cef9e831-d459-4eb5-ad3a-6074ced378cc"}}
